    "body": "Problem: When sending new `textDocument/codeLens` and `codeLens/resolve` requests, stale in-flight requests are not canceled. This can cause a back log in the server, especially in insert mode and/or with large projects.\n\nSolution: Cancel in-flight requests before sending a new one.\n\nCloses: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/42588",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-30T10:09:18Z",
